er the pale cyan or bright cyan tier.\",\"Replace the mantle's multiple diagonal streaks with one short 2-3-pixel highlight cluster near the upper-left edge.\",\"Close outline gaps and eliminate the isolated steps around the right and lower-right extremities so every pixel reinforces a readable mass.\"]}",
